{"vid":"UERsTQFiTqc","source":"UERsTQFiTqc.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.9,"txt":"I do think it's possible to work in a creative field"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"without falling under the title of a starving artist."},{"t":7.2,"txt":"The path is not as laid out yellow brick road style as"},{"t":10.9,"txt":"it is like a corporate career."},{"t":12.5,"txt":"It really is something that you build for yourself. But"},{"t":14.5,"txt":"I also think that that's why,"},{"t":16.2,"txt":"as an end result, that the path of an artist"},{"t":18.3,"txt":"is such a fulfilling one."},{"t":19.9,"txt":"My name is Zoe de la Paz."},{"t":21.3,"txt":"I'm 26 years old."},{"t":22.4,"txt":"My rent is $96 a month."},{"t":24,"txt":"I make $19.25 an hour, and I live and work as a"},{"t":27.3,"txt":"seamstress in Yellowstone National Park."},{"t":31.2,"txt":"So I live in Yellowstone Park in Wyoming,"},{"t":33.8,"txt":"but I work in Montana."},{"t":35.8,"txt":"Living and working in a national park it is like,"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"honestly, sometimes emotionally overwhelming for"},{"t":40.2,"txt":"me just because it's just so indescribably beautiful."},{"t":45.8,"txt":"Really just feel like I'm connected and living with"},{"t":48.1,"txt":"nature and not this separate being."},{"t":50.2,"txt":"Living outside of nature that then chooses when to"},{"t":53.2,"txt":"dip her toes into it."},{"t":55,"txt":"My rent is $96 a month."},{"t":56.6,"txt":"I have one roommate right now,"},{"t":58.2,"txt":"and I do live in the biggest dorms that are available in"},{"t":61.5,"txt":"Mammoth Village. Coming to Yellowstone I did not have a"},{"t":69.8,"txt":"car with me. I do make use of the fact that being in a"},{"t":72.4,"txt":"national park, I feel quite safe to"},{"t":74,"txt":"hitchhike around."},{"t":75.3,"txt":"This sign lives in my bag at all times."},{"t":77.4,"txt":"It also says park employee so that you know I'm not"},{"t":79.8,"txt":"dangerous. Good old hitchhiker's thumb."},{"t":83.7,"txt":"I pay a monthly meal plan which is $359 per month."},{"t":87.5,"txt":"This meal plan gives me access not just to my EDR,"},{"t":91.6,"txt":"employee dining room, but also to the other EDRs"},{"t":94.6,"txt":"that are across the park."},{"t":95.8,"txt":"I do spend my money on food outside of what's available"},{"t":98.6,"txt":"to me at the EDR. I do love cooking and I don't have"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"access to a kitchen here, but that's also one of the"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"benefits is that I don't have to carry the mental"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"load of my groceries."},{"t":108,"txt":"My July spending was a little higher than usual"},{"t":110.2,"txt":"because it was my birthday week in July."},{"t":112.5,"txt":"I had all of my friends and family,"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"or at least the main bulk of them,"},{"t":116.1,"txt":"visiting me almost every single weekend."},{"t":118.1,"txt":"And then in July for two weeks,"},{"t":119.9,"txt":"they provide us with a 40% off discount on everything"},{"t":122.5,"txt":"in the gift shop. And as a result,"},{"t":124.3,"txt":"I wanted to get all of my Christmas shopping in early."},{"t":127.1,"txt":"I don't have health insurance right now,"},{"t":128.8,"txt":"but I do have access to a very low cost employee"},{"t":131.2,"txt":"clinic, which is right across my dorm."},{"t":133.1,"txt":"I have $11,000 in savings, which is a nest egg that"},{"t":135.5,"txt":"I've built for myself. Every day at"},{"t":143.7,"txt":"6:45, I board the employee shuttle."},{"t":146.1,"txt":"The same shuttle drives us back for lunch, and it"},{"t":147.9,"txt":"drives us back at the end of the day for dinner. Welcome"},{"t":155.6,"txt":"to uniforms. I mend and tailor all of the uniforms"},{"t":160,"txt":"for any of the concessionaire employees you"},{"t":162,"txt":"see in the park. Lots of button repairs,"},{"t":164,"txt":"snap repairs. If we get jackets that are damaged,"},{"t":167,"txt":"trying to find a way to mend them so that we don't have"},{"t":169.3,"txt":"to toss them. There are days sometimes where I'm hemming"},{"t":172.4,"txt":"and maybe repairing up to 40 pairs of pants."},{"t":175.6,"txt":"I've never had an official sewing class before."},{"t":178.1,"txt":"Everything I've learned was self-taught. I started"},{"t":180.8,"txt":"sewing when I was 14 years old,"},{"t":182.5,"txt":"and I got my start in sewing through something called"},{"t":185.2,"txt":"cosplay. Growing up in a really small town with not"},{"t":187.9,"txt":"much to do, I was just left to my own devices in my"},{"t":190.4,"txt":"basement and with my grandmother's old Singer"},{"t":193.4,"txt":"sewing machine. Sewing can be quite meditative for me."},{"t":196.5,"txt":"I love how technical it is."},{"t":197.9,"txt":"I love that I get to use not just my hands,"},{"t":200.6,"txt":"but also my brain."},{"t":201.8,"txt":"I truly love my job here."},{"t":203.6,"txt":"My friends will be like, man,"},{"t":205.2,"txt":"I hate my job today."},{"t":206.5,"txt":"Like work was just so difficult."},{"t":208.1,"txt":"I just, I don't want to show up for work tomorrow and"},{"t":211.1,"txt":"I'll have to awkwardly be like, oh yeah,"},{"t":213.5,"txt":"I also just hate my job, you know?"},{"t":215.7,"txt":"Which is just not the truth. Because I really just like,"},{"t":218.1,"txt":"love what I do in this position."},{"t":221.1,"txt":"I do earn less hourly than I did in my former corporate"},{"t":224.8,"txt":"job, but honestly, the trade off is really"},{"t":227.5,"txt":"worth it to me because I get to live in one of the most"},{"t":230.3,"txt":"beautiful places in the world."},{"t":231.8,"txt":"In my opinion, one of the perks of being an"},{"t":234.1,"txt":"employee of the park is that you have access to this"},{"t":236.8,"txt":"employee activities group that does any range of"},{"t":239.5,"txt":"activities. All of these activities are available to"},{"t":242.1,"txt":"the employees to sign up for,"},{"t":243.4,"txt":"at either no cost or very low cost."},{"t":246.7,"txt":"We did an Elephant Back full moon hike last month."},{"t":250,"txt":"That was $4 for me to get a ride there and back."},{"t":253.6,"txt":"One of the other activities that I got to do this month"},{"t":256.1,"txt":"was my friends and I went to Cody,"},{"t":257.8,"txt":"Wyoming for the Cody Rodeo and the cost of my bus"},{"t":261.1,"txt":"ticket there and back was $6."},{"t":264.3,"txt":"I never thought that my hobby could become my"},{"t":266.7,"txt":"career. I was making $75,000 a year"},{"t":275.6,"txt":"as a mechanical designer living in Chicago."},{"t":278.1,"txt":"All of my work was behind a computer."},{"t":279.9,"txt":"I didn't have any sort of emotional connection or tie"},{"t":282.9,"txt":"to the work that I was doing, and that's what made"},{"t":284.8,"txt":"it so hard to be fulfilled by it."},{"t":286.9,"txt":"It definitely was almost reaching at a point of"},{"t":289.4,"txt":"burnout, but it really was one of those moments for me"},{"t":292.3,"txt":"that felt dire of, I need to act now."},{"t":295.1,"txt":"That's when I first reached out to the local nightclub"},{"t":299.6,"txt":"and music venue and started working for them part time,"},{"t":302.1,"txt":"because I just had this vague idea of,"},{"t":304.1,"txt":"I want to work in the art scene,"},{"t":306.1,"txt":"but I don't know where. So I would leave my corporate job"},{"t":308.6,"txt":"at 5 p.m., take the train or take the bus and go clock in"},{"t":312.3,"txt":"as a caterer. We were working as caterers for the"},{"t":314.7,"txt":"crew of different concerts."},{"t":316.2,"txt":"My first sewing job officially came from The"},{"t":319.1,"txt":"Weeknd. The wardrobe team, they ended up bringing me on"},{"t":322.4,"txt":"at the time because they needed some last minute"},{"t":324.3,"txt":"sewing done and they just needed somebody who could"},{"t":326.3,"txt":"sew. I scrawled my name and number and then passed it to"},{"t":328.4,"txt":"them over the breakfast line, and I was like, I can"},{"t":330.4,"txt":"sew. I promise I'll be there if you need me."},{"t":339.6,"txt":"I was like scraping together all of my PTO,"},{"t":342.8,"txt":"all of my sick leave to go work ten,"},{"t":345.3,"txt":"12, sometimes 14 hour days sewing,"},{"t":347.5,"txt":"which I absolutely loved."},{"t":349.4,"txt":"It did feel like I was living a double life because"},{"t":352.5,"txt":"I was pursuing this thing that made me feel so alive."},{"t":356.2,"txt":"I realized that I wanted for myself this life more than I"},{"t":360.9,"txt":"wanted the comfortability that a corporate job gave"},{"t":364.1,"txt":"me. There was a quote that a friend shared with me that"},{"t":366.9,"txt":"really stuck with me."},{"t":368.2,"txt":"Leap and the net will appear."},{"t":369.7,"txt":"And I felt like I reached that point where I was just"},{"t":372.3,"txt":"at that edge, and there was nothing left"},{"t":373.9,"txt":"for me to do. I just had to,"},{"t":375.7,"txt":"I just had to leap and the net would appear."},{"t":387.1,"txt":"This is truly one of the most beautiful,"},{"t":389.3,"txt":"unreal places in the world."},{"t":391,"txt":"Just like being here has changed my life."},{"t":393.2,"txt":"After my contract is up in Yellowstone at the end of"},{"t":395.7,"txt":"September for me, I plan to continue my work"},{"t":398,"txt":"as a seamstress."},{"t":399.1,"txt":"That world is looking for me to either be in LA or New"},{"t":401.6,"txt":"York, but I know regardless of where I end up,"},{"t":404.8,"txt":"that the work I will be doing will continue having"},{"t":408.2,"txt":"me be behind a sewing machine."},{"t":410.5,"txt":"I'm excited for what comes next."},{"t":411.9,"txt":"It's still scary."},{"t":413,"txt":"Like it's scary to think about the fact that less"},{"t":415.9,"txt":"than six months ago, I was working my corporate"},{"t":418.2,"txt":"job, clocking in with my badge,"},{"t":420.6,"txt":"and now it's like, oh, what comes next?"},{"t":423.1,"txt":"But I think having come out here and just being able to"},{"t":426.9,"txt":"be out here has really helped me to feel one,"},{"t":430.1,"txt":"that the world is so large, there's no mistake so great"},{"t":432.7,"txt":"that I can make that I can't come back from."},{"t":434.6,"txt":"I can trust myself to leap and the net will appear."}],"words":[{"t":0.88,"w":"I"},{"t":0.88,"w":"do"},{"t":0.88,"w":"think"},{"t":0.88,"w":"it's"},{"t":0.88,"w":"possible"},{"t":0.88,"w":"to"},{"t":0.88,"w":"work"},{"t":0.88,"w":"in"},{"t":0.88,"w":"a"},{"t":0.88,"w":"creative"},{"t":0.88,"w":"field"},{"t":3.76,"w":"without"},{"t":3.76,"w":"falling"},{"t":3.76,"w":"under"},{"t":3.76,"w":"the"},{"t":3.76,"w":"title"},{"t":3.76,"w":"of"},{"t":3.76,"w":"a"},{"t":3.76,"w":"starving"},{"t":3.76,"w":"artist."},{"t":7.2,"w":"The"},{"t":7.2,"w":"path"},{"t":7.2,"w":"is"},{"t":7.2,"w":"not"},{"t":7.2,"w":"as"},{"t":7.2,"w":"laid"},{"t":7.2,"w":"out"},{"t":7.2,"w":"yellow"},{"t":7.2,"w":"brick"},{"t":7.2,"w":"road"},{"t":7.2,"w":"style"},{"t":7.2,"w":"as"},{"t":10.88,"w":"it"},{"t":10.88,"w":"is"},{"t":10.88,"w":"like"},{"t":10.88,"w":"a"},{"t":10.88,"w":"corporate"},{"t":10.88,"w":"career."},{"t":12.48,"w":"It"},{"t":12.48,"w":"really"},{"t":12.48,"w":"is"},{"t":12.48,"w":"something"},{"t":12.48,"w":"that"},{"t":12.48,"w":"you"},{"t":12.48,"w":"build"},{"t":12.48,"w":"for"},{"t":12.48,"w":"yourself."},{"t":12.48,"w":"But"},{"t":14.52,"w":"I"},{"t":14.52,"w":"also"},{"t":14.52,"w":"think"},{"t":14.52,"w":"that"},{"t":14.52,"w":"that's"},{"t":14.52,"w":"why,"},{"t":16.24,"w":"as"},{"t":16.24,"w":"an"},{"t":16.24,"w":"end"},{"t":16.24,"w":"result,"},{"t":16.24,"w":"that"},{"t":16.24,"w":"the"},{"t":16.24,"w":"path"},{"t":16.24,"w":"of"},{"t":16.24,"w":"an"},{"t":16.24,"w":"artist"},{"t":18.32,"w":"is"},{"t":18.32,"w":"such"},{"t":18.32,"w":"a"},{"t":18.32,"w":"fulfilling"},{"t":18.32,"w":"one."},{"t":19.88,"w":"My"},{"t":19.88,"w":"name"},{"t":19.88,"w":"is"},{"t":19.88,"w":"Zoe"},{"t":19.88,"w":"de"},{"t":19.88,"w":"la"},{"t":19.88,"w":"Paz."},{"t":21.28,"w":"I'm"},{"